    "text": "WACO, Texas ( FOX 44 ) — A new era dawns in Waco in 2025 – The Esrom Era. Esrom Martinez comes over from Midway to lead the Lions back to the glory days of the past to reestablish Waco High as a powerhouse in Texas high school football. Find out how the Lions are adapting to the new coaching staff in our Pigskin Preview above! For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KWKT - FOX 44.",
